# The base quad is in <g2>; the reifier declared ABOUT it, and the annotation on that
# declaration, are in <g3>. Selection is graph-blind, which is what reaches the <g3>
# declaration from a closure seeded in <g2>; emission is graph-faithful, which is what
# keeps it in <g3> instead of moving it beside the triple it reifies.
